+# Private exact quoted-string size proposal
+
+No repository source has been changed. This proposal only accelerates the existing exact integer pre-JSON sizing method in AssetsRawArchive; both old literal layout1 and range layout2 call this same method. All parser-capacity/full-budget guards, raw-before-parse ownership, source clocks and actual getter/input paths remain unchanged.
+
+The exact-string check remains first, before C string operations or regex evaluation. Printable ASCII uses the same length + quote/backslash arithmetic already present in lifecycle_namespace_bill.canonical_size. Non-printable ASCII accounts for the five short escaped controls (+1 each) and other C0 controls/DEL (+5 each). Empty input is accepted. The non-ASCII implementation is the unchanged original loop, including surrogate and astral escaping. No canonical JSON payload is allocated on the production path. The control regex creates one bounded match at a time, rather than copying the payload.
+
+The private equivalence test passed 82,169 vectors against both the original implementation and Python ensure_ascii encoding: all BMP single codepoints, all ASCII pairs, astral/surrogate edges, large printable/control payloads through the existing four-MiB limit, and invalid exact types. Foreign subclass and deceptive-metaclass callbacks stayed at zero. These are host pure-method proofs, not Native or whole-flow evidence.
+
+Four exact returned bodytexts from the retained latest MaxUI5 failure (raw26/27/28/29) measured 92.649 ms old versus 1.740 ms proposed median for their combined full quoted_bytes calls. Nine alternating batches include three repetitions each. All 114 original files and newly opened original-descriptor checks remain unchanged, with known descriptor closure. The measurements exclude SDK, parser/parent/bill work and do not establish aggregate flow deadline success.
+
+The prior MaxUI5 RED remains authoritative: original historical Host1.5 expired post-writer/pre-receipt, with acquired raw/alias/custody retained. No live rerun is authorized by this packet alone.
+
+For integration, extend the existing quoted-length test rather than adding a mirror group. The six existing AssetsRawArchive tests and twenty-one AssetsRawRanges tests cover both layouts, large raw retention, unchanged parser-capacity refusal, identity/OFD/CAS/unknown ownership and final windows. The current five-file InputReference epoch needs a separately pinned sixth-file afterimage if this proposal is selected; never relabel its prior receipts.
